  "description": "Given the head of a singly linked list, group all the nodes with odd indices together followed by the nodes with even indices.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. if (!head || !head.next) return head;\n2. odd = head;\n3. even = head.next;\n4. evenHead = even;\n5. while (even && even.next) {\n6.   odd.next = even.next;\n7.   odd = odd.next;\n8.   even.next = odd.next;\n9.   even = even.next;\n10. }\n11. odd.next = evenHead;\n12. return head;",
